  "notes": [
    "Koningslaan 28A-30 (pand 0363100012237339): a pair of tall eclectic villa-houses on the Koningslaan, their gardens on the Vondelpark.",
    "walls[0] the wider house (surfaces 52, 62, 63, 92 of panel 27; crop w01-207 2025-01-29): dark red-brown brick, five storeys over a souterrain with segmental-arched windows in cream voussoirs, a white timber oriel on the second floor at the right, a round-arched entrance; curved and stepped gables over the cornice (3DBAG roof planes).",
    "walls[1] the narrower house with the corner turret (panel 35; same crop): two window columns, a wrought-iron balcony on the first floor.",
    "INFERRED: surface 35 (the 4.3 m garden room at the west end of panel 27), the park-side rear (crop w02-27p is 81 % foliage) and the party walls (otherWalls brick grid)."
  ],
